2. FastViT-T8 — Apple Core ML model gallery
================================================================================

    .apple-test-fixtures/FastViTT8F16.mlpackage (downloaded, not committed)

This asset is Apple's, not AI Archeology's, and is NOT licensed under
Apache-2.0. It is a test fixture, not an app demo. Unit tests load it directly;
UI tests seed it only when explicitly requested through their launch configuration.
Normal app launches (including normal Debug runs) do not seed it. The Xcode
build embeds it only with AIA_INCLUDE_TEST_FIXTURES=YES in Debug; Release
builds reject fixture opt-in. It is not part of the shipped application. The
previous committed copy under Drivers/Demo Models/ remains in Git history.

Provenance for the downloaded fixture and its historical committed copy:
the fetcher requires byte-for-byte agreement with Apple's published download:

    Source:  https://ml-assets.apple.com/coreml/models/Image/
             ImageClassification/FastViT/FastViTT8F16.mlpackage.zip
    Archive: 7,467,627 bytes
             sha256 156df7e15dd384af30727f1eee4982602924b7e8ae37a65cefa1cfb325261508

    Manifest.json
             sha256 079d99b20fb992f0ef42a9fdc65546a5352c0a86af79cd0bfc766f622a30687d
    Data/com.apple.CoreML/model.mlmodel
             sha256 e6ae04eaff201eb75fc4af13001a1077b2dd371c87082fea81b0688a7b825bd7
    Data/com.apple.CoreML/weights/weight.bin
             sha256 a6aaba06b9664717edeeaa30cc0f72bdf90a481cea9eb573e217b8d3b2c99410

    Fetch or verify with: scripts/fetch_apple_test_models.sh
    Upstream research code:  https://github.com/apple/ml-fastvit

The model's embedded licence metadata links directly to Apple's custom licence:
    https://github.com/apple/ml-fastvit/blob/8af5928238cab99c45f64fc3e4e7b1516b8224ba/LICENSE

Verified on 2026-09-14: the current Apple archive matches the recorded SHA-256,
and all three then-committed model files matched its contents byte-for-byte. The
licence permits redistribution and has no research-only restriction. Retain
Apple's copyright notice, licence text and disclaimers when redistributing
the complete, unmodified model. Apple's terms, not Apache-2.0, cover this asset.

Unmodified upstream licence and referenced acknowledgements are included at:
    ios/TestFixtures/FastViT/FastViT-LICENSE.txt
    ios/TestFixtures/FastViT/FastViT-ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.txt

Keep these texts with distributions containing the model, including historical
copies. See that directory's LICENSE.md and issue #906, A1.

